OL,3,GNEWSAGrandfather beaten to death in
OL,4,Abed, court told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "vulnerable" grandfather was beaten
OL,7,Fto death in his bed with a "blunt
OL,8,Fweapon" by a man he had recently met, a
OL,9,Fcourt has heard.
OL,11,FJohn Boyle, 71, was probably asleep
OL,12,Fwhen he was attacked at his flat in
OL,13,FLeatherland Court, Kettering, jurors at
OL,14,FNorthampton Crown Court were told on
OL,15,FTuesday.
OL,17,FJohn Mills, 46, of Marriott Street,
OL,18,FNorthampton, who is standing trial for
OL,19,Fhis murder, has denied the charge and
OL,20,Fsays someone else was responsible for
OL,21,FBoyle's death.
